  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      631.81,
      475.26,
      690.88
    ],
    "text": "A Statute to provide Supplementary Provisions to previously approved expenditure of the Northern ProvincialCouncil for the financial year 2017 by the Honourable Governor on the 26th day of December 2016 inaccordance to First Schedule to this statute and to make payments by way of advance out of the NorthernProvincial Council funds or monies to provide for the refund of such monies to the Northern ProvincialCouncil funds and to make provisions for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.",
